OL,3,ADavid Walliams accused of sexual
OL,4,Amisconduct after losing injunction bid
OL,5,
OL,6,FITV News and the Guardian have
OL,7,Fpublished reports alleging that David
OL,8,FWalliams has been accused of sexual
OL,9,Fmisconduct by several women, including
OL,10,Fone who was aged 15.
OL,12,FThe allegations were made as a part of
OL,13,Fa joint three-year investigation by the
OL,14,Ftwo news organisations, which was
OL,15,Fpublished after the entertainer lost a
OL,16,Flegal bid to stop the claims against
OL,17,Fhim being made public.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
