OL,3,AUS House to vote on moving forward with
OL,4,AHegseth impeachment
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking at the Pentagon for the first
OL,7,Ftime in six months, the defence
OL,8,Fsecretary called the impeachment effort
OL,9,Fa "farce" and added: "This is sabotage"
OL,11,FDemocratic lawmakers such as minority
OL,12,Fleader Hakeem Jeffries say they back
OL,13,Fimpeaching Hegseth, but President
OL,14,FDonald Trump says his defence secretary
OL,15,Fgets an "'A' PLUS"
OL,17,FVice-President JD Vance has blamed the
OL,18,Fwar for Republicans' sweeping midterms
OL,19,Flosses, but says it is "absurd" to
OL,20,Fsuggest Hegseth has committed
OL,21,Fimpeachable crimes
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
