OL,3,AIsrael's new parliament sworn in as
OL,4,Aleaders compete to form government
OL,5,
OL,6,FIsrael's new parliament has been sworn
OL,7,Fin, as opposition leader Gadi Eisenkot
OL,8,Fseeks to oust caretaker Prime Minister
OL,9,FBenjamin Netanyahu.
OL,11,FThe former army chief has been tasked
OL,12,Fwith forming a government after
OL,13,Freceiving more recommendations from
OL,14,Fmembers of the Knesset than Netanyahu,
OL,15,Falthough not all those backing him are
OL,16,Fwilling to govern together.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
