OL,3,AIsrael's new parliament sworn in as
OL,4,Aleaders compete to form government
OL,5,
OL,6,FEisenkot's bloc of four parties won 48
OL,7,Fseats in October's election, while
OL,8,FNetanyahu's bloc won 53, leaving both
OL,9,Fshort of a majority in the 120-seat
OL,10,FKnesset. He has 28 days to build a
OL,11,Fcoalition, with a possible two-week
OL,12,Fextension.
OL,14,FAlmost half of the new MKs did not
OL,15,Fserve in the previous parliament, while
OL,16,FArab-led parties have a record number
OL,17,Fof seats.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
